          "value": "<p>The M-3 Predator is the most common sidearm in Systems Alliance service, carried as a backup weapon by the majority of Alliance personnel. Lightweight, reliable, and requiring minimal maintenance, it offers adequate stopping power for close-range threats. In the hands of an experienced soldier, its fifteen-round heat sink provides plenty of opportunity to resolve a situation that a primary weapon couldn't finish.</p>"
